      "message": "updated, in the new patch, matchesWifi() checks the following\nif identity is `TYPE_WIFI`\n- if matchSubcriberIds is null or {null} then check if mMatchWifiNetworkKeys is empty or not. If it\u0027s empty then return true, otherwise depends on the result of if wifiNetworkKey matchesWifiNetworkKey().\n- Otherwise, if matchSubcriberIds is not empty then it depends on the result of if subscriberId matchesSubscriberId() and if wifiNetworkKey matchesWifiNetworkKey().\n\nif identity is `TYPE_WIFI_P2P`, then it returns true if (matchSubcriberIds is null or {null} \u0026\u0026 mMatchWifiNetworkKeys is empty), otherwise it returns false.",
